      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1- create \"processingMessages\" helper inside \"convex/system.ts\" , this helper will query all the processing messages\n   in optimized way -> by_project_status index \"projectId\" & \"status\" and protected with internalKey because this route\n   will be triggered from \" Inngest\" ",
