      "text": "2- add tools[] to the agent\n\n    - \"createlistFilesTool()\" -> \"/features/conversations/inngest/tools/list-files.ts\"\n    - \"createReadFilesTool()\" -> \"/features/conversations/inngest/tools/read-files.ts\"\n    - \"createUpdateFile()\" -> \"/features/conversations/inngest/tools/update-files.ts\"\n    - \"createCreateFilesTool()\" -> \"/features/conversations/inngest/tools/create-files.ts\"\n    - \"createCreateFoldersTool()\" -> \"/features/conversations/inngest/tools/create-folders.ts\"\n    - \"createRenameFileTool()\" -> \"/features/conversations/inngest/tools/rename-file.ts\"\n    - \"createScrapeUrlsTool()\" -> \"/features/conversations/inngest/tools/scrape-urls.ts\"\n    - \"createDeleteFilesTool()\" -> \"/features/conversations/inngest/tools/delete-files.ts\"",
